`cargo xtask vocab`: the usage, and its usage errors (exit 2).

```console
$ xtask vocab help
usage: cargo xtask vocab <command> [options]
...

$ xtask vocab
? 2
usage: cargo xtask vocab <command> [options]
...

$ xtask vocab frobnicate
? 2
xtask vocab: unknown command `frobnicate`
...

$ xtask vocab diff
? 2
error: vocab diff needs --against python

$ xtask vocab diff --against rust
? 2
error: --against rust: only `python` (the oracle) is supported

$ xtask vocab sync --bogus
? 2
error: unknown option `--bogus`
...

$ xtask vocab sentinel-attack --stix-dir
? 2
error: --stix-dir needs a directory

```
